ristopher Steele\uc2  is disavowing the part of the dossier concerning \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and prostitutes at the Moscow, \uc2 Ritz-Carlton\uc2 , and something that should happen out of it.\par \par \uc2 Nope, still says in his view, he still thinks that tape probably exists. It remains his view that there was collusion. He believes that tape probably exists.\par \par \uc2 As for the veracity of the other specific allegations in the dossier, he remains adamant that none of them have been disproven, which, of course, will infuriate absolutely everyone.\par \par \uc2 Watch this space.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 [21:56:49]\par \par \uc2 MADDOW: Potentially some big news coming on the issue a booster shots remember, that last week an advisory panel to the \uc2 FDA\uc2  discuss some promising data that suggested that mixing and matching doses of different vaccines could be safe. And it could be particularly effective for people who got the single dose of the \uc2 Johnson & Johnson\uc2  vaccine. Well, tonight, "The \uc2 New York Times\uc2 " is reporting that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  might grant approval for the mix and match approach, as early as this week.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, day after tomorrow, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  is expected to authorize booster shots for the Moderna and J&J. The mix and match recommendation could come that same day, on Wednesday. The CDC will then have its booster shot meeting on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 What that means is it`s possible, that by the end of this week, all three available COVID vaccines may have an approved booster dose, including the option for mixing and matching between brands, which of course would be a big deal.\par \par \uc2 Watch this space.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 MADDOW: All right. That is going to do it for us tonight. We will see you again tomorrow, when I`m scheduled to be hitting a grand slam for the \uc2 Boston Red Sox\uc2 . Everybody gets a turn.\par \par \uc2 Now, it`s time for